  "term": "fluid intelligence",
  "definition": "Fluid intelligence is a form of intelligence that shows close links with working memory and attention processes. In this source, it is discussed as something that can be measured with intelligence tasks and examined for its relationship to visuo-spatial attention and memory capacity.",
